    {
      "id": "codeB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 372,
      "y": 1306,
      "width": 355,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 94834678,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 941813290,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Keep selection on the NARC. Add a drawer\nsub-state for the open subfile, instead of\ncalling select() and replacing InspectorPane.\n\nInspectorPane always mounts NarcBrowser\nwhen the selection is a NARC. If the drawer\nis open, also render NarcDrawer over the\ninspector body.\n\nGrid clicks call openNarcEntry, not select.\nThe existing Breadcrumb stays; the NARC\ncrumb closes the drawer. Folder crumbs\nstill reveal the tree.\n\nselect() of a different file closes the\ndrawer. SpriteViewer must not use\nrefKey as its React key, so zoom and\npalette survive same-type cycling.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Keep selection on the NARC. Add a drawer\nsub-state for the open subfile, instead of\ncalling select() and replacing InspectorPane.\n\nInspectorPane always mounts NarcBrowser\nwhen the selection is a NARC. If the drawer\nis open, also render NarcDrawer over the\ninspector body.\n\nGrid clicks call openNarcEntry, not select.\nThe existing Breadcrumb stays; the NARC\ncrumb closes the drawer. Folder crumbs\nstill reveal the tree.\n\nselect() of a different file closes the\ndrawer. SpriteViewer must not use\nrefKey as its React key, so zoom and\npalette survive same-type cycling.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
